<title>BRAZIL: Opening prices for August 6 Brazil coffee auction.</title>
<headline>Opening prices for August 6 Brazil coffee auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Opening prices for the 85,800 60-kg bags of coffee stocks to be auctioned by the Brazilian government at 1400 local/1700 GMT on August 6 are as follows, according to Banco do Brasil which is holding the sale.</p>
<p>Quantity is given in bags, price in Brazilian reais per bag.</p>
<p>    QTY	CROP	COLOR	LOCATION			PRICE</p>
<p>    7,500   1987/88   Yellowish   Varginha, MG		 138</p>
<p>    5,060     n/a     Yellowish   Londrina, PR		 133</p>
<p>    7,940     n/a     Yellowish   Londrina, PR		 135</p>
<p>    5,000   1987/88   Yellowish   Rolandia, PR		 141</p>
<p>    9,000   1987/88   Yellowish   Nova Fatima, PR	    143</p>
<p>   23,000   1988/89   Greenish    Nova Fatima, PR	    143</p>
<p>	480   1988/89   Robusta     Nova Fatima, PR	     81</p>
<p>    6,716   1988/89   Yellowish   Barueri, SP		  146</p>
<p>    4,103   1986/87   Yellowish   Catanduva, SP		143</p>
<p>    4,270   1986/87   Yellowish   Catanduva, SP		138</p>
<p>    1,455   1987/88   Yellowish   Catanduva, SP		143</p>
<p>	946   1987/88   Yellowish   Catanduva, SP		143</p>
<p>    4,339   1987/88   Yellowish   Oswaldo Cruz, SP	   143</p>
<p>    5,991   1987/88   Yellowish   Oswaldo Cruz, SP	   138</p>
<p>TOTAL - 85,800 bags</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
